---
import PersonalBaseLayout from '../layouts/PersonalBaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Now";
---

<PersonalBaseLayout title={pageTitle}>
	<h1>Personal</h1>
	<p>
		I'm so well rested now that I took October mostly off. So now I'm ready to kick ass! I'm taking some 
		time to figure out some boundaries for myself and take a step back so I don't overexert myself after
		I just got all this energy back. I also gotta invest in an air purifier haha caked on dust is killer.
	</p>
	<div class="divider" style="padding-left:4em"></div>
	<h1>Projects and Things I'm Playing With</h1>
	<p>
		November is writing challenge month! I'm trying to hit 30,000 words across my projects and my blog posts.
	</p>
	<p>
		Social Stealth Game - This is the "Scope Testing Project" from before I'm just slowly revealing a 
		bit more about it. I'm redoing the outline a little to make it more of an actual horror game lol. 
		I'm also rethinking the aesthetics too so a bit of an overhaul.
	</p>
	<p>
		Worldbuilding - I have a few projects I'm doing worldbuilding for, in a few words they are: Pirates with 
		Superpowers, Anthro FF Mystic Quest, and Arts based Magic RPG. Possibly with Otome Telltale Walking Dead.
		
	</p>
	<p>
		Yuri Fantasy Comic - My hypothetical entry for the Big Gay Comic Jam 2026. It's in a world I've wanted to 
		make comics for for a while now didn't have that push I needed just yet. A bar owner pairs two lonely 
		customers together in a world where just about any fantasy creature is on the table!
	</p>
	<div class="divider" style="padding-left:4em"></div>
	<h1>Media</h1>
	<dl>
		<dt><h2>Games</h2></dt>
		<dd>None for now</dd>
		<dt><h2>Most Recent Movie</h2></dt>
		<dd>The VVitch (rewatch)</dd>
		<dt><h2>Shows</h2></dt>
		<dd>None for now</dd>
		<dt><h2>Books</h2></dt>
		<dd>None for now</dd>
	</dl>

		<script>
			import '../scripts/menu.js'
		  </script>
</PersonalBaseLayout>

<style>
	main {
		margin: auto;
		padding: 1rem;
		width: 800px;
		max-width: calc(100% - 2rem);
		font-size: 20px;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	img {
    float:left;
	padding: 2%;
	}
	.astro-a {
		position: absolute;
		top: -32px;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translatex(-50%);
		width: 220px;
		height: auto;
		z-index: -1;
	}
	h1 {
		font-size: 4rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1;
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 0em;
	}
	.link-card-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(24ch, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
		padding: 0;
	}

</style>
